{"unit_id":"leozou320-ai__dsh-web-speech-input#feature-1","repo":"leozou320-ai/dsh-web-speech-input","commit":"8b1450792de9809c3a2d32e905739bf37d9b0478","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-speech-input 的功能「语音听写」：在对话输入框左侧提供麦克风按钮，点击后启动浏览器语音识别。识别到的临时和最终文字会追加到当前草稿，用户停止后可自行编辑和提交。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:93-106","client.js:142-160","client.js:174-178"]}
{"unit_id":"leozou320-ai__dsh-web-speech-input#feature-2","repo":"leozou320-ai/dsh-web-speech-input","commit":"8b1450792de9809c3a2d32e905739bf37d9b0478","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-speech-input 的功能「语言选择」：开始识别时优先采用网页文档语言，其次采用浏览器语言，两者均不可用时回退到 zh-CN。点击麦克风按钮触发识别。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:54-60","client.js:68-80"]}
{"unit_id":"leozou320-ai__dsh-web-speech-input#feature-3","repo":"leozou320-ai/dsh-web-speech-input","commit":"8b1450792de9809c3a2d32e905739bf37d9b0478","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-speech-input 的功能「状态反馈」：按钮随聆听状态切换，并显示识别不支持、权限拒绝、无语音、麦克风或网络错误等提示，帮助用户判断当前听写情况。通过输入框旁的麦克风按钮操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:62-66","client.js:123-160"]}
{"unit_id":"leozou320-ai__dsh-web-speech-input#feature-4","repo":"leozou320-ai/dsh-web-speech-input","commit":"8b1450792de9809c3a2d32e905739bf37d9b0478","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-speech-input 的功能「卸载清理」：组件卸载时尝试终止仍存在的语音识别，并在插件效果清理时移除注入的样式，避免按钮和样式留在页面。该清理随界面或插件卸载自动触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:78-85","client.js:165-172"]}
{"unit_id":"leozou320-ai__dsh-web-speech-input#caveat-1","repo":"leozou320-ai/dsh-web-speech-input","commit":"8b1450792de9809c3a2d32e905739bf37d9b0478","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-web-speech-input 使用浏览器的语音识别实现处理音频；识别服务是否联网及音频处理方式取决于浏览器和操作系统，代码没有指定服务商。使用前确认所用浏览器的语音识别规则。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:68-80","client.js:93-106"]}
